{"suttaId":"thi-ap35","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[10288,10383],"vripara":"111"},"segments":{"thi-ap35:0.3":"Sukkātherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap35:1.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, vipassī nāma nāyako;","thi-ap35:1.3":"Uppajji cārudassano, sabbadhammavipassako.","thi-ap35:2.1":"“Tadāhaṃ bandhumatiyaṃ, jātā aññatare kule;","thi-ap35:2.3":"Dhammaṃ sutvāna munino, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","thi-ap35:3.1":"“Bahussutā dhammadharā, paṭibhānavatī tathā;","thi-ap35:3.3":"Vicittakathikā cāpi, jinasāsanakārikā.","thi-ap35:4.1":"“Tadā dhammakathaṃ katvā, hitāya janataṃ bahuṃ [janatāya hitaṃ bahuṃ (sī.)… sadā (syā.), hitāya janasaṃsariṃ (pī.)];","thi-ap35:4.3":"Tato cutāhaṃ tusitaṃ, upapannā yasassinī.","thi-ap35:5.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, sikhī viya sikhī jino;","thi-ap35:5.3":"Tapanto yasasā loke [lokaṃ (syā. pī.)], uppajji vadataṃ varo.","thi-ap35:6.1":"“Tadāpi pabbajitvāna, buddhasāsanakovidā;","thi-ap35:6.3":"Jotetvā jinavākyāni, tatopi tidivaṃ gatā.","thi-ap35:7.1":"“Ekatiṃseva kappamhi, vessabhū nāma nāyako;","thi-ap35:7.3":"Uppajjittha mahāñāṇī, tadāpi ca tathevahaṃ.","thi-ap35:8.1":"“Pabbajitvā dhammadharā, jotayiṃ jinasāsanaṃ;","thi-ap35:8.3":"Gantvā marupuraṃ rammaṃ, anubhosiṃ mahāsukhaṃ.","thi-ap35:9.1":"“Imamhi bhaddake kappe, kakusandho jinuttamo;","thi-ap35:9.3":"Uppajji narasaraṇo [narasaddūlo (sī. syā. pī.)], tadāpi ca tathevahaṃ.","thi-ap35:10.1":"“Pabbajitvā munimataṃ, jotayitvā yathāyukaṃ;","thi-ap35:10.3":"Tato cutāhaṃ tidivaṃ, agaṃ sabhavanaṃ yathā.","thi-ap35:11.1":"“Imasmiṃyeva kappamhi, koṇāgamananāyako;","thi-ap35:11.3":"Uppajji lokasaraṇo, araṇo amataṅgato [vadataṃ varo, sabbasattānamuttamo (syā.)].","thi-ap35:12.1":"“Tadāpi pabbajitvāna, sāsane tassa tādino;","thi-ap35:12.3":"Bahussutā dhammadharā, jotayiṃ jinasāsanaṃ.","thi-ap35:13.1":"“Imasmiṃyeva kappamhi, kassapo munimuttamo;","thi-ap35:13.3":"Uppajji lokasaraṇo, araṇo maraṇantagū.","thi-ap35:14.1":"“Tassāpi naravīrassa, pabbajitvāna sāsane;","thi-ap35:14.3":"Pariyāpuṭasaddhammā, paripucchāvisāradā.","thi-ap35:15.1":"“Susīlā lajjinī ceva, tīsu sikkhāsu kovidā;","thi-ap35:15.3":"Bahuṃ dhammakathaṃ katvā, yāvajīvaṃ mahāmune.","thi-ap35:16.1":"“Tena kammavipākena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","thi-ap35:16.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","thi-ap35:17.1":"“Pacchime ca bhave dāni, giribbajapuruttame;","thi-ap35:17.3":"Jātā seṭṭhikule phīte, mahāratanasañcaye.","thi-ap35:18.1":"“Yadā bhikkhusahassena, parivuto lokanāyako;","thi-ap35:18.3":"Upāgami rājagahaṃ, sahassakkhena vaṇṇito.","thi-ap35:19.1":"“‘Danto dantehi saha purāṇajaṭilehi, vippamutto vippamuttehi;","thi-ap35:19.3":"Siṅgīnikkhasavaṇṇo, rājagahaṃ pāvisi bhagavā’.","thi-ap35:20.1":"“Disvā buddhānubhāvaṃ taṃ, sutvāva guṇasañcayaṃ;","thi-ap35:20.3":"Buddhe cittaṃ pasādetvā, pūjayiṃ taṃ yathābalaṃ.","thi-ap35:21.1":"“Aparena ca kālena, dhammadinnāya santike;","thi-ap35:21.3":"Agārā nikkhamitvāna, pabbajiṃ anagāriyaṃ.","thi-ap35:22.1":"“Kesesu chijjamānesu, kilese jhāpayiṃ ahaṃ;","thi-ap35:22.3":"Uggahiṃ sāsanaṃ sabbaṃ, pabbajitvācirenahaṃ.","thi-ap35:23.1":"“Tato dhammamadesesiṃ, mahājanasamāgame;","thi-ap35:23.3":"Dhamme desiyamānamhi, dhammābhisamayo ahu.","thi-ap35:24.1":"“Nekapāṇasahassānaṃ, taṃ viditvātivimhito;","thi-ap35:24.3":"Abhippasanno me yakkho, bhamitvāna giribbajaṃ.","thi-ap35:25.1":"“Kiṃ me katā rājagahe manussā, madhuṃ pītāva acchare;","thi-ap35:25.3":"Ye sukkaṃ na upāsanti, desentiṃ amataṃ padaṃ.","thi-ap35:26.1":"“Tañca appaṭivānīyaṃ, asecanakamojavaṃ;","thi-ap35:26.3":"Pivanti maññe sappaññā, valāhakamivaddhagū.","thi-ap35:27.1":"“Iddhīsu ca vasī homi, dibbāya sotadhātuyā;","thi-ap35:27.3":"Cetopariyañāṇassa, vasī homi mahāmune.","thi-ap35:28.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap35:28.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap35:29.1":"“Atthadhammaniruttīsu, paṭibhāne tatheva ca;","thi-ap35:29.3":"Ñāṇaṃ mama mahāvīra, uppannaṃ tava santike.","thi-ap35:30.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap35:31.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap35:32.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap35:33.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ sukkā bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap35:34.1":"Sukkātheriyāpadānaṃ pañcamaṃ.","thi-ap35:34.2":"Pañcamaṃ bhāṇavāraṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
